#: src/DeepreyBathy_pi.cpp:603
msgid ""
"Record depth soundings from your echosounder as you sail, and build your own "
"high-resolution bathymetric chart, rendered live on the chart canvas.\n"
"\n"
"Depth is read from standard NMEA 0183 DPT and DBT sentences and tagged with "
"your GPS position. Soundings accumulate in a local tile database and are "
"drawn as a colour-shaded depth surface with automatic contour lines. Existing "
"survey data can be imported from, and exported to, XYZ files."
msgstr ""

